OL,3,AEarly release scheme could see
OL,4,Adangerous criminals released,
OL,5,AConservatives warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FDangerous criminals could still be
OL,8,Ffreed under the prime minister's early
OL,9,Frelease scheme, shadow justice
OL,10,Fsecretary Nick Timothy has told the
OL,11,FBBC.
OL,13,F"In order to prevent one group of
OL,14,Fdangerous criminals being released
OL,15,Fearly, he's looking at releasing a
OL,16,Fdifferent group of dangerous
OL,17,Fprisoners", Timothy said.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
