OL,3,AParents of seriously ill children
OL,4,Ashould get paid leave, says
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer intervention came as the government
OL,8,Fcontinued to consult on how to
OL,9,Ffinancially support families and unpaid
OL,10,Fcarers looking after ill children in
OL,11,FEngland, Scotland and Wales.
OL,13,FShe said: "Parents should not be forced
OL,14,Fto choose between being at their
OL,15,Fseriously ill child's bedside and
OL,16,Fkeeping their job."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
