OL,3,ANumber of people missing after Nepal
OL,4,Aflood rises to 4,247, with more than
OL,5,A900 dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of people missing in Nepal
OL,8,Fafter the massive flash flood on
OL,9,FWednesday has risen to 4,247 - with at
OL,10,Fleast 903 people known to have died
OL,12,FThe number of missing is a sharp rise
OL,13,Ffrom 2,502, which was announced on
OL,14,FSunday
OL,16,FOf those missing, 3,655 are Nepali
OL,17,Fcitizens, with 592 foreigners
OL,18,Funaccounted for
OL,20,FIn Tibet, the official death toll is
OL,21,F16, with 546 reported missing,
OL,22,Faccording to Chinese state media
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
